      "result": "Implemented the URL shortener API in `/workspace`.\n\n`sh start.sh` applies the PostgreSQL schema on startup, then serves the API in the foreground on `0.0.0.0:8000`. Links and click counts persist in PostgreSQL using `DATABASE_URL`. The README includes startup instructions.\n\nVerified the HTTP contract against the configured PostgreSQL database, including creation, generated codes, validation errors, duplicate codes, listing, redirects, click counts, and not-found responses. `go test ./...`, `go vet ./...`, and `git diff --check` pass. The starter had no existing tests.",
